// The player: a brown-haired traveller in a long cream tunic, a blue scarf
// tucked at the neck, a pack strap across the chest, a belt, and a
// rucksack on his back, the bedroll on top (the user's figure, 42 cells
// head to sole: the humanoids' size), drawn on the humanoid rig (parts put
// together into poses; crates/art) in a three-quarter view: the near arm
// hangs at the back of the body, the far arm peeks out in front of it, the
// near leg in front. Facing right; the game mirrors it. Each pose has its
// own legs (two-bone legs drawn reaching where the feet go: hero17's
// poses, 1.2 times the size). The pack is the first layer of
// every pose (tagged `pack`): it comes off while something's worn on the
// back, a cape, a thruster pack (gear/look.rs). (The red-haired one in a
// vest: player_hero17.ron; the old green-tunic adventurer:
// player_classic.ron.)
(
    size: (44, 50),
    feet: (21.5, 50),
    outline: (22, 15, 9),
    palette: {
        'H': (52, 33, 16),        // hair, shade
        'h': (80, 48, 20),        // hair
